_:r10143909b6e77539e13057cf_cb8f7915661a3226d8ec83923bda910f1fac26b16be3d326833de595bc08a5bd64 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/AttributeSpecification> .
