_:r11e865d9d165ceb99e995ab5_cb503e23b44b4e777ce311547203bc9b99edd87152e7162b3d781f46420d727121 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/AttributeSpecification> .
