_:r45d6d652fe2d6ca5a2142b54_cb10d462596e7d508e70d6e0b570a41b43107abf9ecec7af875de0b79502377b76e <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#predicate> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/type> .
