_:r9b989a77e3fb00ec1cfb9208_cb2245c1069451577df8dcfce8b88a7c7ab7ef733a11d28fa277a4c371fbc198ab9 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#predicate> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> .
_:r9b989a77e3fb00ec1cfb9208_cb2245c1069451577df8dcfce8b88a7c7ab7ef733a11d28fa277a4c371fbc198ab9 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/AttributeSpecification> .
_:r9b989a77e3fb00ec1cfb9208_cb2245c1069451577df8dcfce8b88a7c7ab7ef733a11d28fa277a4c371fbc198ab9 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value> "Python toolbox for inferring whole-brain activity from sparse ECoG recordings. Leverages multi-patient brain data to learn correlation models and uses Gaussian process regression for activity inference." .
